# Project Documentation Standard

Every completed project should ideally have:

### Before

* Vehicle photos
* Existing condition
* Customer objective

### During

* Product photos
* Installation photos
* Important technical steps
* Fitment details

### After

* Completed vehicle
* Final details
* Product list
* Project summary

This documentation can later support marketing, case studies, sales references, and internal knowledge.
